Committed scalar cell, focused
description: the scalar_committed state
- >
  The value is persisted (the surgical op is queued/flushed in the background) and the cell keeps
  focus, caret after the last character. Reached by clicking a committed cell. The cell shows the
  AUTHORED representation - a bare `species>` in the file stays BARE, never re-derived into
  `"species>"`; an authored-quoted token opens as its authored text, quotes as characters (no
  quote mode). A committed token is NOT a dead end - re-editing its text into `key: value` (a
  QUOTED `"key": value` included) RESTRUCTURES it: the mistyped `species>` recovers into
  `species>: 12`; the same applies to the omni SELF-VALUE cell and the document root. Typed spaces
  are spaces - the browser's non-breaking substitutes are normalized before the grammar reads them
- !!<*yamlover: $defs: table>
  header:
    - Event
      width: 2
    - 'Condition / note'
      width: 4
    - 'Next state'
      width: 2
  - ['`alphanumeric`', '', '[unquoted_scalar_appending](::server:yamlover-editor:unquoted_scalar_appending)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the text was edited into `key: value` (quoted key allowed) and the key is free in the node', '`scalar_committed` (stays)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the text was edited into a bare `key:` (no value yet) and the key is free', '[value_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:value_hole)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the text reads `key: value` but the key already exists in the node', '[error_flash](::server:yamlover-editor:error_flash)']
  - ['`enter`', 'otherwise', '[entry_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:entry_hole)']
  - ['`click_outside`', 'the text was edited into `key: value`', '`scalar_committed` (stays)']
  - ['`click_outside`', 'otherwise', '`scalar_committed` (stays)']
  - ['`backspace`', 'caret at the start', '[focus_prev](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_prev)']
  - ['`backspace`', 'otherwise', '[unquoted_scalar_appending](::server:yamlover-editor:unquoted_scalar_appending)']
  - ['`tab`', 'the cell is an entry with a previous ordinal sibling', '`scalar_committed` (stays)']
  - ['`tab`', 'otherwise', '[nop](::server:yamlover-editor:nop)']
  - ['`shift_tab`', 'the cell is an entry below the root level', '`scalar_committed` (stays)']
  - ['`shift_tab`', 'otherwise', '[nop](::server:yamlover-editor:nop)']
  - ['`left_arrow`', '', '[unquoted_scalar_inserting](::server:yamlover-editor:unquoted_scalar_inserting)']
  - ['`up_arrow`', '', '[focus_prev](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_prev)']
  - ['`down_arrow`', '', '[focus_next](::server:yamlover-editor:focus_next)']
